WEBVTT

00:00:01.066 --> 00:00:10.266
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:21.276
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.856 --> 00:00:30.756
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.256 --> 00:00:37.216
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:39.266
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:43.556
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.306 --> 00:00:48.436
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.846 --> 00:00:52.646
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.316 --> 00:01:00.316
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.656 --> 00:01:08.996
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.866 --> 00:01:15.996
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.206 --> 00:01:21.436
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.546 --> 00:01:24.636
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:34.586 --> 00:01:38.856
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:39.056 --> 00:01:41.116
A moment after
they met at Tokyo Tower...

00:01:41.226 --> 00:01:43.856
...the three were swept away
to another world, Cephiro.

00:01:43.966 --> 00:01:47.866
Master Mage Clef
awaited the trio in Cephiro.

00:01:48.636 --> 00:01:51.696
Clef told them that
they were Magic Knights...

00:01:51.806 --> 00:01:55.036
...summoned to Cephiro
in order to save the land.

00:01:56.576 --> 00:01:59.806
Cephiro had turned
into a world of terror...

00:01:59.916 --> 00:02:02.246
...as a result of
High Priest Zagato imprisoning...

00:02:02.346 --> 00:02:05.076
...Princess Emeraude,
the Pillar of the land.

00:02:05.256 --> 00:02:11.216
Presea, the Master Smith
in the Forest of Silence

00:02:30.816 --> 00:02:33.216
They have entered
the Forest of Silence...

00:02:35.416 --> 00:02:37.886
There's been a revolt
in the town of Bentley.

00:02:37.986 --> 00:02:40.246
Ascot, go seize control.

00:02:40.926 --> 00:02:42.016
Right.

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:44.856
Caldina, head east.

00:02:44.956 --> 00:02:47.426
Look for any signs of opposition.

00:02:48.066 --> 00:02:49.256
Got it.

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:51.056
Alcyone...

00:02:51.666 --> 00:02:53.156
Please wait!

00:02:53.266 --> 00:02:55.926
Allow me to follow
the Magic Knights!

00:02:56.636 --> 00:02:59.666
The Magic Knights have
entered the Forest of Silence.

00:02:59.776 --> 00:03:01.866
There is no need to follow them.

00:03:02.376 --> 00:03:04.106
Please, Lord Zagato.

00:03:06.646 --> 00:03:09.586
You cannot use magic
in the Forest of Silence.

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:14.056
Furthermore,
that forest is full of monsters.

00:03:14.626 --> 00:03:17.386
We do not have
to lay a finger on them.

00:03:18.326 --> 00:03:20.986
The forest will
take care of them for us.

00:03:21.366 --> 00:03:22.096
But...

00:03:22.096 --> 00:03:24.466
But...
There is nothing more to discuss.

00:03:25.166 --> 00:03:26.596
Lord Zagato!

00:03:27.736 --> 00:03:30.106
Alcyone, watch over the south.

00:03:30.206 --> 00:03:33.796
Lafarga, fortify the defenses
to the north. That is all.

00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:55.326
Ms. Presea lives here?

00:04:04.906 --> 00:04:06.996
Is her home really here?

00:04:16.686 --> 00:04:19.416
I guess we have
no choice but to proceed.

00:04:19.516 --> 00:04:21.916
But there isn't
an entrance anywhere.

00:04:22.356 --> 00:04:24.156
No way!

00:04:28.866 --> 00:04:31.386
So how are we supposed to enter?

00:04:32.496 --> 00:04:34.296
Why don't we try knocking?

00:04:34.406 --> 00:04:37.396
There aren't any doors!
What are you thinking?

00:04:45.176 --> 00:04:46.306
It opened!

00:04:47.216 --> 00:04:49.016
Everything is worth a try!

00:04:49.286 --> 00:04:50.516
Hello!

00:04:51.186 --> 00:04:52.486
Excuse us!

00:04:54.356 --> 00:04:56.116
I don't think anyone's home.

00:04:56.226 --> 00:04:59.216
We can't just stand here. Let's go in.

00:04:59.826 --> 00:05:01.586
Is that all right, Ms. Umi?

00:05:01.696 --> 00:05:05.796
Is it not wrong to enter
someone's home without permission?

00:05:11.576 --> 00:05:13.536
Pardon us for intruding!

00:05:15.646 --> 00:05:16.806
Excuse us!

00:05:17.816 --> 00:05:19.006
Pardon us!

00:05:25.986 --> 00:05:27.616
That surprised me...

00:05:29.786 --> 00:05:32.086
How careless...
Keeping the door unlocked.

00:05:32.196 --> 00:05:33.956
Don't worry... Don't worry...

00:05:41.836 --> 00:05:42.766
Hello!

00:05:42.866 --> 00:05:44.236
Excuse us!

00:05:51.976 --> 00:05:53.916
I think there's someone here.

00:05:58.956 --> 00:05:59.916
Um...

00:06:00.086 --> 00:06:01.816
Are you Ms. Presea?

00:06:01.926 --> 00:06:04.386
We came because Clef told us to...

00:06:14.706 --> 00:06:16.606
M-Ms. Presea?

00:06:16.976 --> 00:06:19.406
Mokona

00:06:27.216 --> 00:06:28.386
Master Smith Presea

00:06:28.386 --> 00:06:30.116
Master Smith Presea
You fell for it, Mokona.

00:06:30.756 --> 00:06:33.716
You're always making
a mess of my study...

00:06:34.586 --> 00:06:37.456
Now, how should I punish you?

00:06:38.756 --> 00:06:42.256
Shall I pull on your ears
to see how far they stretch?

00:06:43.096 --> 00:06:46.936
Or shall I hang you
upside down from the front door?

00:06:57.776 --> 00:06:58.746
Mokona?

00:07:05.856 --> 00:07:08.786
I always thought something
haunted this old building...

00:07:08.886 --> 00:07:11.756
To think it was cursed
with mischievous children.

00:07:11.856 --> 00:07:13.626
Mischievous children?

00:07:14.096 --> 00:07:16.226
I can't go easy on you
just because you're children.

00:07:17.066 --> 00:07:19.866
Because you ruined
my precious study...

00:07:20.806 --> 00:07:25.036
...shall I pull on your cheeks to see
how big your mouth can open?

00:07:25.636 --> 00:07:29.306
Or shall I boil you three
together in a big pot?

00:07:41.956 --> 00:07:44.516
You're cute!
So your name's Mokona?

00:07:46.226 --> 00:07:50.596
This is a slight problem. The mess
in the study we are innocent of...

00:07:50.696 --> 00:07:54.396
...but it is true that we entered
the house without permission.

00:07:54.506 --> 00:07:57.766
She certainly has
a good reason to be angry.

00:07:59.136 --> 00:08:02.876
You've got to be kidding!
It's her fault for being so careless!

00:08:02.976 --> 00:08:06.176
The wall opened on its own
when Hikaru touched it!

00:08:06.276 --> 00:08:07.946
If this were Tokyo...

00:08:08.646 --> 00:08:10.416
What did you just say?

00:08:11.486 --> 00:08:13.886
I said, "If this were Tokyo..."

00:08:14.726 --> 00:08:16.186
No, before that!

00:08:16.286 --> 00:08:19.786
I said, "The wall opened
on its own when Hikaru touched it!"

00:08:19.896 --> 00:08:23.956
Sorry for entering without permission,
but we called out many times!

00:08:24.436 --> 00:08:26.396
This can't be...

00:08:26.536 --> 00:08:28.866
They can't possibly be this young...

00:08:29.136 --> 00:08:32.076
But considering that
Mokona is this happy...

00:08:33.236 --> 00:08:36.006
You three are the
Magic Knights, aren't you?

00:08:36.676 --> 00:08:39.406
Yeah. I'm Hikaru Shidou.

00:08:40.916 --> 00:08:42.546
I'm Umi Ryuuzaki.

00:08:43.586 --> 00:08:45.346
I am Fuu Hououji.

00:08:46.416 --> 00:08:49.116
We're here because
Clef told us to come.

00:08:49.226 --> 00:08:51.196
He told us to find Presea.

00:08:51.296 --> 00:08:53.286
So are you Ms. Presea?

00:08:55.266 --> 00:08:56.226
Look out!

00:09:04.336 --> 00:09:06.606
Presea! Open this cage!

00:09:06.946 --> 00:09:08.606
Hikaru, don't be such a fool...

00:09:08.606 --> 00:09:09.836
Hikaru, don't be such a fool...
Open it!

00:09:29.166 --> 00:09:30.286
Presea!

00:09:46.376 --> 00:09:47.346
Flame...

00:09:48.086 --> 00:09:49.706
...Arrow!

00:09:59.896 --> 00:10:00.856
Flame...

00:10:01.896 --> 00:10:02.796
...Arrow!

00:10:16.176 --> 00:10:19.546
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:10:33.296 --> 00:10:35.026
Didn't Clef tell you?

00:10:35.126 --> 00:10:38.226
This is the Forest of Silence.
Magic doesn't work here.

00:10:39.266 --> 00:10:43.166
I see! That is why
the bird that brought us here...

00:10:43.266 --> 00:10:47.036
...disappeared the moment
we set foot into this forest.

00:10:47.976 --> 00:10:50.736
Clef... couldn't tell us everything.

00:10:51.616 --> 00:10:54.706
While he was explaining,
one of Zagato's minions came...

00:10:55.716 --> 00:10:59.516
Go west. Presea will be waiting
for you in the Forest of Silence.

00:10:59.616 --> 00:11:00.986
Clef...

00:11:01.086 --> 00:11:05.316
Did you know this would happen?
Is this why you left Mokona with me?

00:11:07.596 --> 00:11:11.126
Follow me.
I want to show you something.

00:11:21.876 --> 00:11:23.306
Hikaru, let's go!

00:11:23.406 --> 00:11:24.376
Yeah!

00:11:43.296 --> 00:11:44.386
Wow!

00:11:46.266 --> 00:11:48.396
Now, choose a weapon you like.

00:11:49.106 --> 00:11:52.796
You are so kind!
To provide us with weapons for free!

00:11:55.676 --> 00:11:57.106
We did it!

00:11:57.776 --> 00:12:01.266
It never works like this
in a role-playing game!

00:12:01.716 --> 00:12:03.146
It's not free.

00:12:03.586 --> 00:12:05.816
What? We need money?

00:12:06.756 --> 00:12:10.016
Things never
work out so easily, after all.

00:12:21.706 --> 00:12:25.106
I think I forgot my wallet in my bag.

00:12:26.136 --> 00:12:28.576
I don't have
any money right now...

00:12:28.676 --> 00:12:30.836
...so this is all I have.

00:12:35.616 --> 00:12:37.106
I don't need money.

00:12:37.216 --> 00:12:39.516
But you said it wasn't free.

00:12:39.856 --> 00:12:42.616
Choose any weapon
you wish from here.

00:12:42.986 --> 00:12:45.656
But they will not be your weapons.

00:12:46.026 --> 00:12:48.396
I'm only loaning them to you.

00:12:49.226 --> 00:12:52.526
Every weapon is made
specifically for one person.

00:12:53.196 --> 00:12:57.466
I haven't made your weapons yet.
Weapons just for you.

00:12:58.106 --> 00:12:59.076
Us...

00:12:59.736 --> 00:13:00.966
For us...

00:13:01.606 --> 00:13:02.906
Just for...

00:13:03.376 --> 00:13:05.676
So choose any weapon you like.

00:13:05.776 --> 00:13:09.836
It's dangerous to head unarmed
to the legendary Spring of Eterna.

00:13:10.716 --> 00:13:12.416
The legendary spring?

00:13:12.516 --> 00:13:16.076
I told you. I'm going
to make weapons just for you.

00:13:16.226 --> 00:13:19.586
Weapons that can
only be used by you.

00:13:19.696 --> 00:13:23.756
So you'll become true Magic Knights
when the legendary battle comes.

00:13:24.936 --> 00:13:26.226
Thank you...

00:13:26.696 --> 00:13:29.896
So please go get
the raw materials yourselves.

00:13:34.876 --> 00:13:36.566
R-Raw materials?

00:13:36.676 --> 00:13:39.876
You three, following
the legend, will go to Eterna.

00:13:40.216 --> 00:13:42.906
There, you'll gather
ore called escudo.

00:13:43.016 --> 00:13:45.576
I will make weapons with it.

00:13:45.816 --> 00:13:47.046
Escudo?

00:13:48.326 --> 00:13:49.286
Yes.

00:13:49.786 --> 00:13:53.956
The one ore in Cephiro that can
become weapons that evolve.

00:13:54.766 --> 00:13:57.196
What do you mean by
weapons that evolve?

00:13:57.796 --> 00:13:59.666
Weapons created from escudo...

00:13:59.766 --> 00:14:03.726
...evolve based on the owner's
skills and mental strength.

00:14:04.776 --> 00:14:09.076
That's a useful weapon! We won't
have to keep buying better weapons!

00:14:09.176 --> 00:14:13.136
But if the owner doesn't grow,
the sword doesn't evolve either.

00:14:15.646 --> 00:14:19.416
Depending on how one sees it,
it is easier to buy better weapons.

00:14:19.516 --> 00:14:19.916
Thud

00:14:19.916 --> 00:14:22.586
Thud
Skilled or not, a strong weapon...

00:14:22.586 --> 00:14:23.996
Thud
...will still give one good results.

00:14:23.996 --> 00:14:24.756
...will still give one good results.

00:14:25.526 --> 00:14:29.296
In any case, for you
to become Magic Knights...

00:14:29.826 --> 00:14:32.996
...you must evolve
weapons made of escudo.

00:14:33.366 --> 00:14:34.336
Why?

00:14:35.566 --> 00:14:40.066
A weapon of escudo serves as one
of the keys to reviving the Rune-God.

00:14:40.776 --> 00:14:42.076
Rune-God?

00:14:42.846 --> 00:14:47.076
You cannot fight evenly against
Zagato without the Rune-God.

00:14:47.986 --> 00:14:51.936
Mr. Clef mentioned that as well.
What exactly is the Rune-God?

00:14:55.856 --> 00:14:58.286
A large being of immense power.

00:14:59.326 --> 00:15:01.056
I don't know the details...

00:15:01.166 --> 00:15:05.026
...but you Magic Knights
will recognize it at first glance.

00:15:12.476 --> 00:15:14.096
Out of the way!

00:15:26.316 --> 00:15:30.346
What is that monster doing here?
I thought Ms. Presea got rid of it!

00:15:30.456 --> 00:15:34.156
Choose a weapon quickly! Before
the monster breaks the door open!

00:15:34.266 --> 00:15:35.126
Right!

00:15:37.226 --> 00:15:40.356
There are so many!
I don't know which to choose!

00:15:40.466 --> 00:15:43.736
You don't know anything, do you?
Close your eyes and focus!

00:15:46.236 --> 00:15:47.366
Hurry!

00:16:24.416 --> 00:16:25.216
It's coming.

00:16:25.216 --> 00:16:25.876
It's coming.
Why do we have to fight right away?

00:16:25.876 --> 00:16:28.006
Why do we have to fight right away?

00:16:30.416 --> 00:16:32.046
I will go first.

00:16:38.326 --> 00:16:39.456
Let's go.

00:16:40.496 --> 00:16:41.466
Yeah!

00:16:57.276 --> 00:16:58.576
We did it!

00:17:03.946 --> 00:17:05.246
Ms. Hikaru!

00:17:14.696 --> 00:17:16.856
What kinda thing is this?

00:17:16.966 --> 00:17:21.726
It collapses easily yet returns to its
original shape. It is just like mud.

00:17:21.836 --> 00:17:22.806
Mud?

00:17:23.136 --> 00:17:25.896
This isn't the time
to be complimenting it!

00:17:30.816 --> 00:17:32.746
Is there a lake nearby?

00:17:33.216 --> 00:17:35.686
A lake? There's one in the yard...

00:17:35.786 --> 00:17:37.216
Take us there!

00:17:38.256 --> 00:17:39.216
Hurry!

00:17:55.366 --> 00:17:56.456
This way!

00:17:58.336 --> 00:18:00.306
Ms. Presea, can I use this?

00:18:00.406 --> 00:18:01.376
Y-Yes.

00:18:09.916 --> 00:18:10.976
Hikaru!

00:18:11.316 --> 00:18:14.116
Umi! Fuu!
Quickly, turn it around!

00:18:15.286 --> 00:18:16.876
I understand now!

00:18:19.156 --> 00:18:21.646
Hey, you!
The slowest monster in the world!

00:18:21.766 --> 00:18:24.626
If you didn't like that comment,
I dare you to come here!

00:18:28.136 --> 00:18:30.656
Umi! Fuu!
Get out of the way!

00:19:07.546 --> 00:19:10.446
How did you know
the monster's weakness?

00:19:11.476 --> 00:19:13.536
It's all thanks to Fuu.

00:19:13.646 --> 00:19:16.476
It's because
she said it was like mud...

00:19:17.016 --> 00:19:18.146
I see!

00:19:18.986 --> 00:19:22.756
I'm sorry.
I made a mess of that tablecloth.

00:19:25.596 --> 00:19:27.856
We were saved because of you.

00:19:27.966 --> 00:19:30.726
One tablecloth is nothing
compared to that.

00:19:31.496 --> 00:19:33.266
Don't worry about it.

00:19:53.516 --> 00:19:54.676
It's all right.

00:19:54.786 --> 00:19:57.776
Your weapons are stored safely
inside your gloves' ornaments.

00:19:58.426 --> 00:20:02.656
They will reappear in your hands
if you will them to be there.

00:20:15.446 --> 00:20:17.676
After fighting that monster...

00:20:19.346 --> 00:20:21.776
How can she sleep so soundly?

00:20:22.446 --> 00:20:24.216
I agree with you.

00:20:25.986 --> 00:20:30.616
Following what Mr. Clef said is
becoming one immense undertaking.

00:20:30.726 --> 00:20:34.526
We might not be so fortunate with
other monsters in the future.

00:20:35.096 --> 00:20:38.356
Oh, please!
Don't say such dangerous things!

00:20:40.236 --> 00:20:44.226
It will be all right.
As long as we stay with Ms. Hikaru.

00:20:44.336 --> 00:20:46.136
With this hotheaded girl?

00:20:46.736 --> 00:20:50.336
Did you not think
her fighting style was splendid?

00:20:51.016 --> 00:20:54.706
I do not know about myself,
but I believe Ms. Hikaru...

00:20:54.816 --> 00:20:58.576
...just might become
the Magic Knight Mr. Clef mentioned.

00:21:04.856 --> 00:21:09.796
She was amazing, even if she
looks like she's still in grade school.

00:21:09.896 --> 00:21:10.866
Yes.

00:21:22.376 --> 00:21:24.896
Mokona knows the way to Eterna.

00:21:25.316 --> 00:21:29.116
And Mokona has everything
you need for your journey.

00:21:30.446 --> 00:21:33.446
Make sure you come back
with the escudo in hand.

00:21:33.556 --> 00:21:36.076
I'll make you splendid weapons.

00:21:37.556 --> 00:21:39.886
And besides, I want
to tell you what I think of this.

00:21:40.966 --> 00:21:42.156
This is food, right?

00:21:42.626 --> 00:21:45.066
Yeah! We'll be on our way!

00:21:46.236 --> 00:21:47.996
Hey, wait for me!

00:21:51.476 --> 00:21:53.636
I wonder what escudo is like?

00:21:53.636 --> 00:21:55.436
I wonder what escudo is like?
I have no idea.

00:22:01.286 --> 00:22:02.376
Somehow...

00:22:03.916 --> 00:22:09.146
I somehow hope that Princess
Emeraude is looking over them.

00:22:25.806 --> 00:22:30.206
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:31.776 --> 00:22:37.376
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:38.816 --> 00:22:44.386
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:45.126 --> 00:22:48.956
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:51.266 --> 00:22:54.426
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:54.636 --> 00:22:57.066
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:58.176 --> 00:23:01.976
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:03.006 --> 00:23:09.646
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:10.386 --> 00:23:15.646
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:16.026 --> 00:23:22.826
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:23.326 --> 00:23:28.766
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:44.016 --> 00:23:46.246
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:46.356 --> 00:23:50.156
Seeking the legendary ore
escudo and guided by Mokona...

00:23:50.256 --> 00:23:52.016
...we headed for Eterna.

00:23:52.126 --> 00:23:55.156
But a monster
attacked us along the way.

00:23:55.696 --> 00:23:58.396
Umi and Fuu were in trouble...

00:23:58.496 --> 00:24:01.726
...when a boy named Ferio
saved them in the nick of time.

00:24:01.836 --> 00:24:03.466
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:04.436 --> 00:24:07.306
Ferio, the Mysterious
and Handsome Swordsman.

00:24:07.406 --> 00:24:07.906
Ferio, the Mysterious
and Handsome Swordsman

00:24:07.906 --> 00:24:10.046
Ferio, the Mysterious
